          %h2#References References
          %p Textbook account
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ieke+Moerdijk"}> Ieke Moerdijk
              \.
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gonzalo+Reyes"} Gonzalo Reyes
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Models+for+Smooth+Infinitesimal+Analysis"} Models for Smooth Infinitesimal Analysis
              Springer (1991)
          %p
            The concept of
            = succeed "-rings" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi C
                      %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+differential+geometry"} synthetic differential geometry
            in general was introduced in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bill+Lawvere"}> Bill Lawvere
                ,
                %em Categorical dynamics
              %p
                in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anders+Kock"} Anders Kock
                (eds.)
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Topos+theoretic+methods+in+geometry"} Topos theoretic methods in geometry
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Various Publ. Ser.
          %p
            but examples of the concept are older. A discussion from the point of view of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/functional+analysis"} functional analysis
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              G. Kainz,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andreas+Kriegl"} Andreas Kriegl
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Michor"} Peter Michor
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi C
                          %mn ∞
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
                  \-algebras from the functional analytic view point
              %strong 46
              1 (1987) 89-107 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-4049(87)90045-4"} doi:10.1016/0022-4049(87)90045-4
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.mat.univie.ac.at/~michor/c-oo-alg.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            A characterization of those
            = succeed "-rings" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi C
                      %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifold"} smooth manifold
            is given in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Michor"}> Peter Michor
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ji%C5%99%C3%AD+Van%C5%BEura"} Jiří Vanžura
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Characterizing algebras of
                  = succeed "-functions" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msup
                            %mi C
                            %mn ∞
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
              %strong 37
              3 (1996) 519–521
              %p
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/9404228"}> arXiv:math/9404228
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://eudml.org/doc/247941"} eudml:247941
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.emis.de/journals/CMUC/pdf/cmuc9603/michor.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Studies of the properties of
            = succeed "-rings" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi C
                      %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ieke+Moerdijk"}> Ieke Moerdijk
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gonzalo+Reyes"} Gonzalo Reyes
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/RingsOfSmoothFunctionsI.pdf", :title => "Rings of Smooth Functions and Their Localizations, I"} Rings of Smooth Functions and Their Localizations, I
              , Journal of Algebra 99 (1986)
          %p
            The notion of the spectrum of a
            = succeed "-ring" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi C
                      %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi C
                      %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/schemes"} schemes
            is discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eduardo+Dubuc"}> Eduardo Dubuc
              ,
              %em
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msup
                        %mi C
                        %mn ∞
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
                \-schemes
              Amer. J. Math. 103 (1981) (
              %a{:href => "http://www.math.ist.utl.pt/~jroquet/Dubuc.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed ")." do
                %a{:href => "http://www.jstor.org/stable/select/2374046"} JSTOR
          %p and more generally in
          %ul#BungeDubuc
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ieke+Moerdijk"}> Ieke Moerdijk
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gonzalo+Reyes"} Gonzalo Reyes
                %em Rings of smooth functions and their localization II
                , in
                %em Mathematical logic and theoretical computer science
                page 275 (
                %a{:href => "http://books.google.nl/books?id=w02XaOa_0HAC&pg=PA262&lpg=PA262&dq=smooth+zariski+topos&source=bl&ots=Hj0AN3Lz3y&sig=TqRwTXz_u5R30AN2udLNOMQ2Ly0&hl=nl&ei=mCWZS-eLJcaD-QalyZlS&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=2&ved=0CA4Q6AEwAQ#v=onepage&q=smooth%20zariski%20topos&f=false"}> Google books
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marta+Bunge"}> Marta Bunge
                ,
                = succeed "," do
