                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msup
                            %mi C
                            %mn ∞
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
                Cahiers de Topologie et Géométrie Différentielle Catégoriques, 27 no. 3 (1986), p. 3-22 (
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item?id=CTGDC_1986__27_3_3_0"}> numdam
                ).
          %p More recent developments along these lines are in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dominic+Joyce"}> Dominic Joyce
              ,
              %em
                Algebraic geometry over
                = succeed "-rings" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi C
                          %mn ∞
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\infty
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1001.0023"}> arXiv:1001.0023
              )
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+geometry"} higher geometry
            generalization to a theory of
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+smooth+manifold"} derived smooth manifold
            = succeed "s" do
